findings.recommendation:
Add an azurerm_monitor_diagnostic_setting resource targeting azurerm_network_security_group.nsg, with log categories NetworkSecurityGroupEvent and NetworkSecurityGroupRuleCounter enabled, and destination set to azurerm_log_analytics_workspace.network.id. Example:

resource "azurerm_monitor_diagnostic_setting" "nsg" {
  name                       = "diag-nsg-demo-ai"
  target_resource_id         = azurerm_network_security_group.nsg.id
  log_analytics_workspace_id = azurerm_log_analytics_workspace.network.id

  enabled_log { category = "NetworkSecurityGroupEvent" }
  enabled_log { category = "NetworkSecurityGroupRuleCounter" }
}
